<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>EcoSense — Monitoramento de Energia</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Schibsted+Grotesk:wght@700;800&family=Bricolage+Grotesque:wght@700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg-dark:      #354024;
    --bg-darker:    #2F3D05;
    --green-strong: #2F5A20;
    --green-mid:    #889063;
    --green-soft:   #8A9B68;
    --cream:        #E5D7C4;
    --cream-2:      #F5E9D3;
    --tan:          #CFBB99;
    --brown:        #4C3D19;
    --danger-2:     #EF4444;
    --warn:         #D97706;
    --warn-bg:      #FEF3C7;
    --ok:           #4CAF50;
    --ok-2:         #10B981;
    --white-7:      rgba(255,255,255,.72);
    --line:         rgba(245,233,211,.16);
    --card:         rgba(245,233,211,.08);
    --font-ui:      'Inter', sans-serif;
    --font-body:    'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    --font-display: 'Schibsted Grotesk', sans-serif;
    --font-hero:    'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif;
    --maxw: 1240px;
    --radius: 18px;
  }
  *{ box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0; }
  html{ scroll-behavior:smooth; }
  body{
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    background: var(--bg-darker);
    color: var(--cream-2);
    min-height:100vh;
  }
  a{ color:inherit; text-decoration:none; }
  button{ font-family:inherit; }
  :focus-visible{ outline:2px solid var(--green-soft); outline-offset:2px; }
  .container{ max-width:var(--maxw); margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px; }
  
  .screen{ display:none; }
  .screen.active{ display:block; }
  .screen.active.full-center { display:flex; }
  
  .view{ display:none; }
  .view.active{ display:block; }

  .full-center{
    min-height:100vh; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;
    justify-content:center; gap:20px; text-align:center; padding:40px 20px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% -10%, #2F3D05 0%, #10140a 65%, #0a0c06 100%);
  }

  .logo-circle{
    width:88px; height:88px; border-radius:44px; background:var(--green-strong);
    border:3px solid var(--green-mid); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-size:38px;
  }
  .brand-title{ font-family:var(--font-hero); font-weight:800; font-size:34px; color:var(--cream); }
  .brand-sub{ font-family:var(--font-ui); font-weight:500; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:3px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--tan); }

  .login-card{ width:100%; max-width:400px; background:rgba(245,233,211,.05); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:24px; padding:32px 28px; text-align:left; }
  .field{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:6px; margin-bottom:18px; }
  .field label{ font-size:13px; font-weight:500; color:var(--tan); }
  .field input, textarea, .support-input, select{
    width:100%; height:50px; border-radius:12px; border:1px solid transparent; background:var(--cream-2);
    padding:0 16px; font-size:15px; font-family:var(--font-ui); color:var(--brown);
  }
  .field input:focus, textarea:focus{ border-color:var(--green-soft); outline:none; }
  textarea{ height:120px; padding:14px 16px; resize:vertical; }
  .btn-primary{
    width:100%; height:52px; border:none; border-radius:12px; background:var(--green-strong);
    color:var(--cream); font-weight:700; font-size:15px; cursor:pointer; transition:filter .15s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover{ filter:brightness(1.12); }
  .btn-danger{
    background: #991B1B; color: #FEE2E2; border: none; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 20px;
    font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; transition: filter .15s;
  }
  .btn-danger:hover{ filter: brightness(1.15); }
  .btn-secondary{
    background: rgba(245,233,211,.15); color: var(--cream-2); border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 18px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover{ background: rgba(245,233,211,.25); }
  .link-center{ text-align:center; color:var(--tan); font-size:13px; margin-top:16px; }

  .navbar{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50; background:rgba(53,64,36,.92); backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .navbar-inner{ max-width:var(--maxw); margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px; height:68px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:24px; }
  .brand{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:700; font-size:19px; color:var(--cream); flex-shrink:0; }
  .brand .dot{ width:34px; height:34px; border-radius:10px; background:var(--green-strong); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:17px; }
  .nav-links{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:4px; }
  .nav-link{
    background:none; border:none; color:var(--white-7); font-size:14px; font-weight:600; padding:9px 16px;
    border-radius:10px; cursor:pointer; font-family:var(--font-ui); white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .nav-link:hover{ color:var(--cream-2); background:rgba(245,233,211,.06); }
  .nav-link.active{ color:var(--bg-darker); background:var(--cream-2); }
  .status-pill{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; font-size:12px; color:var(--white-7); background:rgba(245,233,211,.08); border-radius:999px; padding:6px 12px; flex-shrink:0; }
  .status-dot{ width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--ok); }
  .hamburger{ display:none; background:none; border:none; color:var(--cream); font-size:22px; cursor:pointer; }

  @media (max-width: 860px){
    .nav-links{
      position:absolute; top:68px; left:0; right:0; background:var(--bg-dark); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
      flex-direction:column; align-items:stretch; padding:8px; gap:2px; display:none;
    }
    .navbar.nav-open .nav-links{ display:flex; }
    .nav-link{ text-align:left; padding:12px 14px; }
    .status-pill{ display:none; }
    .hamburger{ display:block; }
  }

  main{ max-width:var(--maxw); margin:0 auto; padding:32px 24px 80px; }
  .page-head{ margin-bottom:28px; }
  .page-head h1{ font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:30px; font-weight:700; color:var(--cream); }
  .page-head p{ color:var(--white-7); font-size:14px; margin-top:6px; }

  .card{ background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:20px; }
  .grid{ display:grid; gap:14px; }
  .grid-stats{ grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(170px,1fr)); }
  .grid-2col{ grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px,1fr)); }
  .stat-label{ font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.5px; color:var(--white-7); font-weight:600; }
  .stat-value{ font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:700; font-size:22px; color:var(--cream-2); margin-top:6px; }

  /* Hero dinâmico (Normal e Alerta Vermelho) */
  .hero{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr; gap:20px; margin-bottom:20px; }
  @media (max-width: 800px){ .hero{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
  .hero-main{
    position:relative; overflow:hidden; background:linear-gradient(160deg, var(--green-soft), #6c7d4c);
    border-radius:24px; padding:32px; box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
    transition: background .4s ease;
  }
  .hero-main.alerta-ativo{
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #b91c1c, #7f1d1d) !important;
  }
  .hero-main::before{
    content:''; position:absolute; top:-80px; right:-80px; width:260px; height:260px; border-radius:50%;
    background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,.18), transparent 70%);
  }
  .live-badge{ display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:var(--bg-darker); border-radius:999px; padding:5px 12px; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:var(--cream-2); }
  .pulse-dot{ width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%; background:var(--cream-2); }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference){ .pulse-dot{ animation:pulse 1.6s infinite; } }
  @keyframes pulse{ 0%,100%{opacity:1} 50%{opacity:.3} }
  .hero-num{ font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:800; font-size:clamp(48px,7vw,72px); color:#fff; line-height:1; margin-top:16px; }
  .hero-sub{ font-size:13px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.85); margin-top:6px; }
  .hero-tip{ display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start; margin-top:22px; padding-top:18px; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25); font-size:13px; color:#fff; }
  .hero-side{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; }
  .bars{ display:flex; align-items:flex-end; gap:5px; height:110px; }
  .bar-col{ flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:flex-end; align-items:center; gap:4px; height:100%; }
  .bar{ width:100%; background:var(--cream-2); opacity:.75; border-radius:3px 3px 0 0; min-height:2px; }
  .bar-col.peak .bar{ opacity:1; background:var(--ok-2); }
  .bar-label{ font-size:9px; color:var(--white-7); }

  .tabs{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; padding:6px; margin-bottom:20px; }
  .tab{ flex:1; min-width:90px; text-align:center; padding:10px 12px; border-radius:10px; font-size:13px; font-weight:600; cursor:pointer; background:none; border:none; color:var(--cream-2); }
  .tab.active{ background:var(--cream-2); color:var(--bg-darker); }
  .tab:hover:not(.active){ background:rgba(245,233,211,.08); }

  .banner-warn{ background:var(--warn-bg); color:var(--warn); border-radius:16px; padding:16px 18px; margin-bottom:20px; }
  .banner-warn b{ display:block; margin-bottom:4px; font-size:14px; }
  .alert-row{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:12px; padding:16px; }
  .alert-left{ display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:flex-start; }
  .sev-dot{ width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:5px; }
  .alert-title{ font-size:14px; font-weight:700; }
  .alert-desc{ font-size:12px; color:var(--white-7); margin-top:2px; }
  .alert-time{ font-size:11px; color:var(--white-7); opacity:.75; white-space:nowrap; }

  .tip-card{ display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:flex-start; background:var(--cream); border-radius:16px; padding:18px; color:#141309; }
  .tip-card .ic{ width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px; background:var(--green-mid); display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center; font-size:18px; flex-shrink:0; }
  .tip-card h4{ font-family:var(--font-hero); font-size:15px; }
  .tip-card p{ font-size:12.5px; opacity:.8; margin-top:3px; }
  .resource-card{
    display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center; background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:16px; padding:16px; cursor:pointer; transition:background .15s;
  }
  .resource-card:hover{ background:rgba(245,233,211,.13); }
  .resource-card .r-icon{ width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px; background:var(--green-strong); display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center; font-size:17px; flex-shrink:0; }
  .r-title{ font-size:13.5px; font-weight:700; }
  .r-sub{ font-size:11.5px; color:var(--white-7); margin-top:2px; }
  .r-go{ margin-left:auto; color:var(--tan); }

  section.block{ margin-bottom:36px; }
  section.block h2{ font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:19px; margin-bottom:14px; color:var(--cream-2); }

  .support-card{ max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; background:var(--green-mid); border-radius:24px; padding:32px; }
  .support-card label{ font-size:12px; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:700; color:var(--cream-2); letter-spacing:.4px; }
  .support-confirm{ max-width:600px; margin:16px auto 0; background:rgba(255,255,255,.05); border-radius:16px; padding:16px; font-size:13px; color:#D3E2B6; display:none; }

  footer{ border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:24px; text-align:center; color:var(--tan); font-size:12px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ============ LOGIN / CADASTRO ============ -->
  <section id="screen-login" class="screen active full-center">
    <div class="logo-circle">🌿</div>
    <h1 class="brand-title">EcoSense</h1>
    <p class="brand-sub">MONITOR DE ENERGIA</p>
    
    <form id="form-auth" class="login-card">
      <div class="field">
        <label>E-mail</label>
        <input type="email" id="auth-email" placeholder="voce@email.com" required>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Senha</label>
        <div style="position: relative; width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center;">
          <input type="password" id="auth-senha" placeholder="••••••••" required style="padding-right: 46px;">
          <span id="toggle-senha" style="position: absolute; right: 14px; cursor: pointer; user-select: none; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1; z-index: 10;">👁️</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="field" id="campo-cep" style="display: none;">
        <label>CEP da Residência</label>
        <input type="text" id="auth-cep" placeholder="37540-000" maxlength="9">
      </div>

      <button class="btn-primary" id="btn-auth-submit" type="submit">Entrar</button>
      
      <p class="link-center">
        <span id="auth-toggle-text">Não tem conta?</span> 
        <b id="auth-toggle-btn" style="cursor: pointer; text-decoration: underline;">Cadastre-se</b>
      </p>
    </form>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ APP ============ -->
  <div id="screen-app" class="screen">
    <nav class="navbar" id="navbar">
      <div class="navbar-inner">
        <!-- Logo clicável que volta para o início -->
        <div class="brand" onclick="goToView('dashboard')" style="cursor: pointer;" title="Voltar ao início">
          <span class="dot">🌿</span>EcoSense
        </div>

        <div class="nav-links" id="nav-links">
          <button class="nav-link active" data-view="dashboard" onclick="goToView('dashboard')">Início</button>
          <button class="nav-link" data-view="reports" onclick="goToView('reports')">Relatórios</button>
          <button class="nav-link" data-view="alerts" onclick="goToView('alerts')">Alertas</button>
          <button class="nav-link" data-view="learn" onclick="goToView('learn')">Aprenda</button>
          <button class="nav-link" data-view="support" onclick="goToView('support')">Suporte</button>
        </div>

        <!-- Engrenagem à esquerda do status do sensor -->
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
          <button class="nav-link" data-view="settings" onclick="goToView('settings')" title="Configurações" style="padding: 6px 10px; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1;">
            ⚙️
          </button>
          
          <span class="status-pill" id="status-sensor-pill">
            <span class="status-dot" id="status-sensor-dot"></span>
            <span id="status-sensor-text">Verificando...</span>
          </span>
        </div>

        <button class="hamburger" onclick="document.getElementById('navbar').classList.toggle('nav-open')">☰</button>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <main>
      <!-- ---- DASHBOARD ---- -->
      <section id="view-dashboard" class="view active">
        <div class="page-head">
          <h1>Painel em tempo real</h1>
          <p>Consumo medido agora pelo seu sensor EcoSense.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Seletor clicável de visualização -->
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px;">
          <button type="button" class="btn-secondary active" id="btn-show-potencia" onclick="trocarModoHero('potencia')" style="padding: 8px 16px;">⚡ Potência (W)</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn-secondary" id="btn-show-tensao" onclick="trocarModoHero('tensao')" style="padding: 8px 16px;">🔌 Tensão (V)</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn-secondary" id="btn-show-corrente" onclick="trocarModoHero('corrente')" style="padding: 8px 16px;">🔋 Corrente (A)</button>
        </div>

        <div class="hero">
          <!-- Card interativo com clique para alternar métricas -->
          <div class="hero-main" id="hero-card" onclick="alternarModoHero()" style="cursor: pointer;" title="Clique para alternar entre Potência, Tensão e Corrente">
            <span class="live-badge"><span class="pulse-dot"></span>AO VIVO · <span id="hero-modo-tag">POTÊNCIA</span> (toque para alternar)</span>
            <div class="hero-num" id="dash-power">-- W</div>
            <div class="hero-sub" id="dash-current">Tensão: 227.0 V · Corrente: 0.80 A · <span id="dash-updated">atualizado agora</span></div>
            <div class="hero-tip">🌱 <span id="dash-tip">Calculando status do sensor...</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-side">
            <div class="card"><div class="stat-label">Consumo hoje</div><div class="stat-value" id="dash-kwh">-- kWh</div></div>
            <div class="card">
            <div class="stat-label">Custo estimado</div>
            <div class="stat-value" id="dash-cost">R$ --</div>
            <div style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--white-7); margin-top: 4px;" id="dash-concessionaria-info">Tarifa regional: carregando...</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-stats" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
          <div class="card"><div class="stat-label">Média</div><div class="stat-value" id="dash-avg">--</div></div>
          <div class="card"><div class="stat-label">Pico</div><div class="stat-value" id="dash-max">--</div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:12px;">
            <b style="font-size:14px;">⚡ Histórico Recente de Potência (Watts)</b>
            <span style="font-size:12px; color:var(--white-7);">Clique nas colunas para ver detalhes</span>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:stretch;">
            <!-- Eixo lateral de valores -->
            <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:space-between; font-size:10px; color:var(--white-7); padding-bottom:18px; text-align:right; min-width:38px;">
              <span id="dash-scale-max">-- W</span>
              <span id="dash-scale-mid">-- W</span>
              <span>0 W</span>
            </div>
            <!-- Área do Gráfico de Barras -->
            <div class="bars" id="dash-bars" style="flex:1; height:120px; border-left:1px solid var(--line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); padding-left:6px;"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ---- REPORTS ---- -->
      <section id="view-reports" class="view">
        <div class="page-head"><h1>Relatórios</h1><p>Acompanhe o consumo ao longo do tempo.</p></div>

        <div class="tabs">
          <button class="tab active" data-rep="diario" onclick="setReportTab('diario')">Tempo Real (Hoje)</button>
          <button class="tab" data-rep="semanal" onclick="setReportTab('semanal')">Histórico Semanal</button>
        </div>

        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1.2fr; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          <div class="card">
            <b id="rep-chart-title" style="font-size:15px; display:block; margin-bottom: 8px;">Consumo</b>
            <div class="bars" id="rep-bars" style="margin-top:24px; height:210px; align-items: flex-end;"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="card" style="overflow-x: auto;">
            <b style="font-size:14px; display:block; margin-bottom: 10px;">📋 Detalhamento</b>
            <table style="width: 100%; font-size: 12px; text-align: left; border-collapse: collapse;">
              <thead>
                <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--tan);">
                  <th style="padding: 6px 4px;">Data/Dia</th>
                  <th style="padding: 6px 4px;">Valor</th>
                  <th style="padding: 6px 4px;">Custo</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody id="rep-tabela-corpo"></tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="rep-trend-banner" style="margin-bottom:12px;"></div>
        <p style="font-size:12px; color:var(--white-7); line-height:1.6; margin-bottom:20px;" id="rep-explainer"></p>

        <div class="grid grid-stats">
          <div class="card"><div class="stat-label">Média</div><div class="stat-value" id="rep-avg">--</div></div>
          <div class="card"><div class="stat-label">Máximo</div><div class="stat-value" id="rep-max">--</div></div>
          <div class="card"><div class="stat-label">Mínimo</div><div class="stat-value" id="rep-min">--</div></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ---- ALERTS ---- -->
      <section id="view-alerts" class="view">
        <div class="page-head"><h1>Alertas</h1><p>Anomalias e avisos de consumo.</p></div>

        <div class="banner-warn" id="alert-banner-potencia" style="display:none;">
          <b>⚠️ Alerta Crítico: Consumo Elevado!</b>
          A potência instantânea ultrapassou o seu limite configurado de <span id="alert-limite-val">--</span> W.
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-2col">
          <div class="card alert-row">
            <div class="alert-left"><span class="sev-dot" style="background:var(--danger-2);"></span>
              <div><div class="alert-title">Pico de potência detectado</div><div class="alert-desc" id="alert-peak-desc">--</div></div>
            </div><div class="alert-time">agora</div>
          </div>
          <div class="card alert-row">
            <div class="alert-left"><span class="sev-dot" style="background:var(--warn);"></span>
              <div><div class="alert-title">Consumo acima da média</div><div class="alert-desc">Baseado nas leituras do seu sensor.</div></div>
            </div><div class="alert-time">hoje</div>
          </div>
          <div class="card alert-row">
            <div class="alert-left"><span class="sev-dot" style="background:var(--ok-2);"></span>
              <div><div class="alert-title">Sensor conectado</div><div class="alert-desc">Comunicação serial ativa (115200 bps).</div></div>
            </div><div class="alert-time">agora</div>
